# Universal File Format Converter v1.3.0

Adds spreadsheets to the target format picker and the floating converter’s quick-format settings.

- Read Excel workbooks and CSV files and export to XLSX, XLSM, or CSV.

- Preserve table structure where possible and lay out wide tables on landscape PDF pages.

